Śatrughna asks Cyavana about Lavaṇa spear and past victims --- Cyavana recalls Ikṣvāku king Māndhātr̥ famed in three worlds --- Māndhātr̥ conquers earth then seeks heaven from Indra --- Indra demands earth subjection noting Lavaṇa defies him --- Shamed Māndhātr̥ returns and sends envoy to Lavaṇa --- Lavaṇa eats envoy and Māndhātr̥ attacks with arrows --- Lavaṇa laughs seizes spear and burns king with army --- Cyavana declares spear unsurpassed yet promises Śatrughna victory tomorrow